<title>ADAM – STE Rule Implementation Summary</title>
<style>
  body {
    font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 10pt;
    margin: 2cm;
    color: #000;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: 14pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 2pt;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: 11pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 10pt;
    margin-bottom: 2pt;
    border-bottom: 1pt solid #333;
  }
  p.subtitle {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 9pt;
    color: #444;
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 8pt;
  }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 9pt;
    margin-bottom: 6pt;
  }
  th {
    background-color: #1a1a2e;
    color: #ffffff;
    padding: 3pt 5pt;
    text-align: left;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  td {
    padding: 2pt 5pt;
    border-bottom: 0.5pt solid #ccc;
    vertical-align: top;
  }
  tr:nth-child(even) td {
    background-color: #f5f5f5;
  }
  .badge {
    color: #1a7a1a;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .note {
    font-size: 8pt;
    color: #555;
    margin-top: 4pt;
  }
  .footer {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 8pt;
    color: #555;
    margin-top: 10pt;
    border-top: 0.5pt solid #ccc;
    padding-top: 4pt;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

